<div id="draft-conflict" class="draft-notice" role="alert" hidden>
  <p>另一個分頁已更新草稿。此分頁的修改仍保留在畫面中，尚未覆蓋其他分頁。</p>
  <div class="completion-actions">
    <button type="button" class="button button--quiet" id="draft-load-latest">載入其他分頁草稿</button>
    <button type="button" class="button button--quiet" id="draft-keep-local">保留此分頁並覆蓋</button>
  </div>
</div>
